   "text": "South Korea: +82.080.467.8774",
   "type": "list",
   "section": "Conclusion"
  },
  {
   "id": "b072",
   "page": null,
   "text": "Palo Alto Networks has shared these findings with our fellow Cyber Threat Alliance (CTA) members. CTA members use this intelligence to rapidly deploy protections to their customers and to systematically disrupt malicious cyber actors. Learn more about the Cyber Threat Alliance.",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "section": "Conclusion"
  },
